            "meaning": "The SELECT joins the applicable hatch to its ship and tests opening>B/2. Its OR of NOT EXISTS checks hatch-owned deflection and typed cover/fitting evidence. The field restored or moved to that hatch is the sole failed conjunct.",
            "query_sha256": "37eb6a7002a1450f776bdbb28760c98ea11cb86286b3bd96eca06073836889c9",
            "query": "\n            PREFIX nltl: <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#>\n            PREFIX qudt: <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/>\n            PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\n            PREFIX xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>\n\n            SELECT $this\n            WHERE {\n                $this nltl:shipBreadth ?breadthQuantity ;\n                      nltl:hasWeatherdeckHatch ?hatch .\n                ?breadthQuantity qudt:numericValue ?breadthValue ;\n                                  qudt:unit <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/M> .\n                ?hatch nltl:hatchOpeningLength ?openingQuantity .\n                ?openingQuantity qudt:numericValue ?openingValue ;\n                                  qudt:unit <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/M> .\n\n                FILTER (?openingValue > (?breadthValue / 2))\n\n                FILTER (\n                    NOT EXISTS {\n                        ?hatch nltl:shipSideDeflection ?deflectionQuantity .\n                        ?deflectionQuantity qudt:numericValue ?deflectionValue ;\n                                             qudt:unit <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/M> .\n                    }\n                    ||\n                    NOT EXISTS {\n                        ?hatch nltl:hasHatchCoverDesignEvidence ?coverEvidence .\n                        ?coverEvidence rdf:type nltl:hatchCoverDesignEvidence .\n                    }\n                    ||\n                    NOT EXISTS {\n                        ?hatch nltl:hasHatchFittingDesignEvidence ?fittingEvidence .\n                        ?fittingEvidence rdf:type nltl:hatchFittingDesignEvidence .\n                    }\n                )\n            }\n        ",
